# 🛡️ Web3 Smart Contract Audit Plugin

> **500+ vulnerability patterns** | **Multi-chain support** | **Real-world PoCs**

## 🚀 Quick Start

This plugin provides comprehensive security knowledge for smart contract auditing across multiple chains.

### Supported Chains
- **EVM** (Ethereum, Arbitrum, Optimism, Base, Polygon)
- **Solana** (Anchor framework)
- **ZK Circuits** (Circom, Cairo, zkWasm)
- **Cosmos** (CosmWasm)
- **Move** (Aptos, Sui)

